    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's not even that i want attention or anything. it's just the math of it all. looking at the sheer scale of this city, it feels like my whole existence is just rounding error. like, the universe wouldn't even feel the dip if i just wasn't here. it feels more real than the idea of being \"important.\"",
