      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "That feeling of performing for an absent audience is exhausting, and it's a very honest assessment of modern life. If the universe is indifferent, then the effort to \"stay\" becomes purely self-directed, a choice you make for yourself. You don't have to justify your existence to the city or the cosmos; you can simply choose what makes the immediate moment feel less heavy.",
      "source": "target",
